gh detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width: 640px; width: 100%;\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Files</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Attach documents to this request. Accepted formats are PDF, PNG, JPG and CSV, up to 25 MB per file.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button id=\"tab-empty\" class=\"btn btn-sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"show('empty')\">Empty state</button>\n      <button id=\"tab-error\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"show('error')\">Error state</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"state-empty\" class=\"card stack gap-lg center\" style=\"padding: 48px 32px; text-align: center;\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm center\">\n        <h3>No files yet</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"max-width: 380px;\">Drag and drop files here, or browse your device to upload. Everything stays attached until you submit the request.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-lg\" type=\"button\">\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-right:8px;\">+</span> Upload files\n      </button>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">PDF, PNG, JPG or CSV · up to 25